eed in every job, no matter the difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/9e3998e458cd37eea384e3ff30bf974b.poster.avif?t=1750276227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/9e3998e458cd37eea384e3ff30bf974b.webm?t=1750276227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/9e3998e458cd37eea384e3ff30bf974b.mp4?t=1750276227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1750276227\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the strange and unexpected world of Control or venture in for the first time in this standalone, multiplayer experience. Discover the iconic and unfathomable headquarters of the FBC \u2014 the Oldest House \u2014 from an entirely new perspective as a team of volunteer first responders with nothing but gear and guts to bring the Bureau back from the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.poster.avif?t=1750276227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.webm?t=1750276227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1e